Z||000000||Galen||10-01-2001||10:05 PM||||Hi, I'm Galen.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>If any of ya'll use mirc, how bout coming over to my friends network, irc.slackersguild.com 6667 and chatting  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I'm normally in #Fiero and #StarGate (as well #ChatZone)<P>I'll be waiting for ya..<P>------------------<BR><B>Ray</B> Webmaster of <A HREF="http://www.fierolinks.f2s.com/" TARGET=_blank>Fierolinks</A><BR>"The price of love is tragedy"||||reg||1
Z||000001||Monkeyman||10-02-2001||03:44 AM||||I've heard of MIRC for a long time, but never investigated it.  What's it all about?  I understand that it stands for "something Internet Relay Chat".  What makes it different/better than any of the other chats such as Yahoo or MSN?<p>[This message has been edited by Monkeyman (edited 10-02-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||LarryB||10-02-2001||03:15 PM||||mIRC is just a client that runs on a Windows machine that lets you connect to IRC (Internet Relay Chat) servers.   There are a number of clients available for a bunch of different platforms including Macintoshes and Unix machines.<P>As for the basics of what IRC is and how to use it, a great place to start is <A HREF="http://www.irchelp.org/irchelp/new2irc.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.irchelp.org/irchelp/new2irc.html</A> <P>There are several publically available networks of IRC servers chained together - distributed computing at its finest  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> - and there are a number of private networks and individual standalone servers.  I'm one of the admins for a private network and run an internal site for my company as well.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>I've heard of MIRC for a long time, but never investigated it.  What's it all about?  I understand that it stands for "something Internet Relay Chat".  What makes it different/better than any of the other chats such as Yahoo or MSN?<P>[This message has been edited by Monkeyman (edited 10-02-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||10
